{"thread":{"threadID":2453,"boardID":166,"topic":"Afk Kick","time":1431973095,"userID":null,"username":"Kain","lastPostTime":1432389552,"lastPoster":"eQuin0x +]","replies":11,"views":783,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":25099,"threadID":2453,"userID":null,"username":"Kain","subject":"Afk Kick","time":1431973095,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Guten Tag/Abend</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich wollte vorschlagen, dass man einen AFK kick einbaut der alle sich nicht bewegende Personen nach ungefähr 2 Minuten automatisch kickt oder in den Spec mode versetzt. So müssten die Admin&#x27;s nicht dauerhaft nachschauen ob Leute AFK sind und es würde das Farmen von Punkten verringert werden.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":25103,"threadID":2453,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1431974262,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>An sich kein schlechter Einfall, doch würde ich persönlich, sollte das zustande kommen, den Timer auf 1min bis 1:30 stellen sonst verlieren die Spieler zu viele Punkte beim gespawnkillt werden.<br> <span class=\"missing-media\">[dafuer*]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MfG Ven</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":25104,"threadID":2453,"userID":1787,"username":"Putin","subject":"","time":1431974277,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1671,"username":"Gimme","time":1431974340,"value":1},{"userID":1696,"username":"Breezy","time":1431982094,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Gibt es doch schon oder irre ich mich? Zumindest auf dem Course Server wird man nach einiger Zeit zum Specmode versetzt.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":25106,"threadID":2453,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1431974364,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Der SurfDM beinhaltet dieses Feature (noch) nicht, doch wie gesagt, es wäre eine Überlegung wert.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MfG Ven</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":25107,"threadID":2453,"userID":1671,"username":"Gimme","subject":"","time":1431974368,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Also aufm MG und Course wird man in den Spec gesetzt wenn man so ungefähr 1:30 afk ist</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MfG</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":25109,"threadID":2453,"userID":1797,"username":"TrollingTheTrolls","subject":"","time":1431975189,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1431976905,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Kleine Information am rande.<br>Jeder CS:GO Server beinhaltet einen Intigrierten AFK KICK.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Echt ?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ja Echt!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Beweis ?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Klar</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Keine weiteren Kommentare...</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":25110,"threadID":2453,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1431975299,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wenn dir das eQuin0x auch so bestätigen kann, dann ist fein <span class=\"missing-media\">[^.^]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wäre ja gut möglich, dass er das damals ausgestellt hat</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":25159,"threadID":2453,"userID":1132,"username":"eQuin0x +]","subject":"","time":1431984592,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","time":1431985700,"value":1},{"userID":1430,"username":"mar1o :)","time":1431985789,"value":1},{"userID":1793,"username":"Phantom","time":1432058435,"value":1},{"userID":1099,"username":"Weekend","time":1432468460,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Der AFK Manager wurde auf den SurfDM gepackt und auf allen anderen Servern nocheinmal richtig eingestellt.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":25182,"threadID":2453,"userID":1725,"username":"MrSchnubbl","subject":"","time":1432043532,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>jetzt ist nur das problem, das wenn man spectator im surf Easy Server ist, dass man auch dann gekickt wird wenn man so zu sagen nix macht (also zuguckt)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":25203,"threadID":2453,"userID":1132,"username":"eQuin0x +]","subject":"","time":1432051683,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1525,"username":"Benni","time":1432051777,"value":1},{"userID":1725,"username":"MrSchnubbl","time":1432071306,"value":1},{"userID":1099,"username":"Weekend","time":1432468462,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>MrSchnubbl</strong></cite><p>jetzt ist nur das problem, das wenn man spectator im surf Easy Server ist, dass man auch dann gekickt wird wenn man so zu sagen nix macht (also zuguckt)<br></p></blockquote><p>Ganz vergessen, wurde auf Advanced Surf, Bhop, Climb &amp; Easy Surf wieder geändert.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":25671,"threadID":2453,"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","subject":"","time":1432388767,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>eQuin0x +]</strong></cite><p>wurde auf Advanced Surf, Bhop, Climb &amp; Easy Surf wieder geändert<br></p>